Mycelium — quick README

This folder contains the Mycelium tooling and mushroom outputs.

See the one-page usage guide:

- `Mycelium/RTFM - Usage_Guide.md` — short cheat sheet with examples.

Quick pointers

- Main manager script: `Mycelium/Wiki_File_System_Manager.py`
  - Bulk operations: find/replace, collectionfile recreation, append strings.
  - Tagging: `--add-tags`, `--remove-tags`, `--infer-tags`.
  - Graph: `--export-graph <out.json>` (writes nodes/edges JSON).
  - Root mushroom block: `--write-root-mushrooms <id...>` (writes a JSON list between `<!-- BEGIN-ROOT-MUSHROOMS -->` and `<!-- END-ROOT-MUSHROOMS -->`).
  - Other flags: `--paths`, `--include`, `--exclude-dir`, `--ext`, `--dry-run`, `--backup`, `--debug`.

Example (dry-run to preview inferred tags for this folder):

```bash
python3 Mycelium/Wiki_File_System_Manager.py --paths Mycelium --include "**/*.md" --infer-tags --dry-run
```

Example (export a graph JSON for this folder):

```bash
python3 Mycelium/Wiki_File_System_Manager.py --paths Mycelium --include "**/*.md" --export-graph Mycelium/graphs/mygraph.json
```

If you need a longer manual, see `MANUALS/` or ask to generate a combined PDF/manual for the repo.
